  "description": "<p>An HTTP PUT request that includes an X-If-State-Token header must be rejected with a 412 (Precondition Failed) response if the implementation supports state tokens, but the client-supplied value does not match the resource's current state token.</p>\n\n<p>  cf: <a href=\"https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#state-tokens\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#state-tokens</a><br/>\n </p>",
